      "InvoiceAdminOut": {
        "description": "One OpsGrids invoice as staff sees it on an account's Billing tab \u2014 read-only, and\nnarrower than `InvoiceOut` on purpose: no lines, no subscription id, no void reason. A\ncross-tenant read has no use for what an invoice *contains*, and the smaller the surface the\nsmaller the blast radius of a bug in it.\n\n`status` is billing's own `state`, verbatim: `finalized` (issued, and the only live one) or\n`void`. There is **no paid date and no paid status here, deliberately**: billing records what\nwas billed and never whether it was collected \u2014 collection lives in payment-service and in\nsubscription's dunning \u2014 so a `paid_at` on this shape would be a field with nothing real to\nfill it. `issued_at` is `finalized_at`, the moment the document became immutable.",
        "properties": {
          "currency": {
            "title": "Currency",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "issued_at": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "format": "date-time",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Issued At"
          },
          "number": {
            "title": "Number",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "organization_id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Organization Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "period_end": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Period End",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "period_start": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Period Start",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "total_minor": {
            "title": "Total Minor",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "voided_at": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "format": "date-time",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Voided At"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "organization_id",
          "number",
          "status",
          "period_start",
          "period_end",
          "total_minor",
          "currency"
        ],
        "title": "InvoiceAdminOut",
        "type": "object"
      },
